          "type": "text",
          "text": "A fair spinner has 12 equal sectors numbered 1, 1, 2, 2, 2, 3, 3, 4, 4, 4, 4, 5. It is spun once. Find the probability that the result is a factor of 12. Give your answer as a fraction in simplest form."
        }
      ],
      "marks": 4,
      "primary_outcome": "2.2",
      "secondary_outcomes": [],
      "response": {
